body+='<div class="cards"><div class="card"><strong class="metric">'+str(sum(s['passed'] for s in suites))+'/'+str(len(suites))+'</strong>Regression suites pass</div><div class="card"><strong class="metric">0</strong>Theme Check errors in source and five merchant candidates</div><div class="card"><strong class="metric">273</strong>Documentation modules</div><div class="card"><strong class="metric">6</strong>Open release gates</div></div>'
body+='<h2>Support and documentation delivered</h2><p>Searchable instructions cover 158 source sections, 102 theme blocks and all 225 global controls in 13 groups. Each control includes usage guidance and its schema options, defaults or range. The 12,920 control occurrences include repeated controls in inline block schemas, not 12,920 unique settings. Setup guides cover templates, content, overrides and optional integrations.</p><p><a href="https://quadratum-theme.myshopify.com/pages/features?view=documentation&amp;preview_theme_id=146655674452">Open QA documentation</a> · <a href="https://quadratum-theme.myshopify.com/pages/features?view=customer-care&amp;preview_theme_id=146655674452">Open QA support</a></p><p>These are installed in an unpublished, password-protected store. A rendered contact form does not prove inbox delivery or meet the public support gate by itself.</p>'
body+='<h2>What the brand previews are</h2><p>The nine active brand links open hosted preview themes inside the shared Quadratum store. EVERREAL is paused. These previews share catalog and administrative state; they are not independently prepared Theme Store preset demo stores. The five selected presets still need their own prepared demo destinations and fresh-install comparisons. Future client stores are not pre-submission evidence.</p>'
body+='<h2>New findings and implemented changes</h2>'+table(['ID / priority','Cause','Implemented change','Files and evidence'],[(i['id']+' / '+i['severity'],i['root_cause'],i['change'],i['files']+' — '+i['evidence_and_limits']) for i in registry])
body+='<h2>Package and test evidence</h2>'+table(['Target','Errors','Warnings','Saved settings'],[(r['name'],r['errors'],r['warnings'],'Pass' if r['settings_passed'] else 'Fail') for r in checks])
body+='<p>Source verification uses a byte-identical snapshot of all eight theme folders plus listings, with SHA-256 hashes checked against the checkout. This avoids recursively indexing engineering output and historical build caches, which exhausted the CLI’s default memory in a direct repository scan. All theme files are retained and no check rules are suppressed. The five candidate checks inspect their separate fresh staged packages.</p>'
body+='<p>Warnings remain: each merchant candidate has 117 excessive-setting, 144 variable-name, 36 Liquid-complexity, 30 orphaned-snippet, 10 unused-assign, 3 block-ID and 1 remote-asset warnings. No warning category was suppressed to claim readiness. See raw Theme Check reports for file/line details. The source also contains showroom and development snippets excluded from merchant packages.</p><p>Tests use explicit Shopify adapters; they verify source contracts and browser-like fixtures. They do not prove real payments, email delivery, app behavior, every image crop or cross-browser acceptance.</p>'
body+='<h2>All 22 checklist areas</h2>'+table(['Area','Status','Project evidence and remaining work'],[(r[1],r[2],r[3]) for r in matrix])
body+='<h2>Release gates</h2>'
