body+='<h2>Measured acceptance procedure</h2><p>Follow <a href="https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/best-practices/performance/testing-for-performance">Shopify’s benchmark procedure</a>: prepare its development-store dataset, install the frozen candidate, generate a shareable preview and append pb=0. Measure home, product and collection on mobile and desktop, using three runs and the median for each page. Retain raw results and the simple average: performance at least 60, accessibility at least 90. No results have been invented.</p>'
body+='<h2>Next release sequence</h2><ol>'+''.join('<li>'+esc(p)+'</li>' for p in plan)+'</ol><h2>Baselines and limits</h2><p>Branch: <code>ultima/part-1</code><br>Starting HEAD: <code>cf42b029d06d17e53d50e12f21e269bb4a729c33</code><br>HEAD when report generated: <code>'+esc(head)+'</code><br>Main baseline: <code>a2af1499177a83af6753795648fc286020fb2af3</code></p><p>Theme ID 146655674452 remains unpublished. Merchant candidates contain current working-tree runtime and hashed manifests. The final commit includes this report; its own SHA cannot be embedded in itself. No submission ZIP is cleared.</p>'
